<title>UK: Rugby-Guscott withdraws from Eng. test against Aus.</title>
<headline>Rugby-Guscott withdraws from Eng. test against Aus.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>British Lions centre Jeremy Guscott withdrew on Tuesday from England's test squad to play Australia on July 12.</p>
<p>Guscott, who kicked the drop goal which clinched the Lions' 18-15 win over South Africa in Saturday's second test in Durban, has decided to return home to see his new-born daughter Shaskia.</p>
<p>Uncapped Northampton centre Matt Allen replaces him.</p>
</text>
